{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136290/extras/7566c4e7a6a06a266c4f2b3bf6378000.webp?t=1771870111\" width=579 height=38 /></span><br>Kick Bot 2 - the TWO BUTTON platformer where you can\u2019t walk \u2013 only wall-jump!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save humanity from a giant robot leg attached to the moon that wants to KICK THE EARTH! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil AI banished to the moon is out for revenge! Stop the AI's giant robot GigaLeg from kicking Earth into oblivion. Play as Kick Bot, humanity's last hope! Infiltrate the GigaLeg and defeat the AI deep in the Lunar Cortex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136290/extras/63f42adc88035c78a66e7343768411df.poster.avif?t=1771870111\" width=480 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136290/extras/63f42adc88035c78a66e7343768411df.webm?t=1771870111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136290/extras/63f42adc88035c78a66e7343768411df.mp4?t=1771870111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136290/extras/0afa27dbb021c71eb8813738344881eb.avif?t=1771870111\" width=598 height=111 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Wall jump, slide, butt stomp, and dash through 7 unique worlds of tough-as-nails levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Simple two-button controls, but many challenging maneuvers to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Respawn fast! There's no time to waste.</p></li><li><p class=